egular","unseen":false,"pinned":false,"unpinned":null,"excerpt":"多么快乐的一天。 \n雾早就散了，我在花园里干活。 \n蜂鸟停在忍冬花的上面。 \n尘世中没有什么我想占有。 \n我知道没有人值得我去妒忌。 \n无论我遭受了怎样的不幸， \n我都已忘记。 \n想到我曾是同样的人并不使我窘迫 \n我的身体里没有疼痛。 \u0026hellip;","visible":true,"closed":false,"archived":false,"bookmarked":null,"liked":null,"like_count":1,"views":10,"category_id":1,"featured_link":null,"op_like_count":1,"posters":[{"extras":null,"description":"原始发帖人","user":{"id":3,"username":"海边2026","name":"Vivian Huang","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/palmpoetry.discourse.group/海边2026/{size}/20_2.png","trust_level":1}},{"extras":"latest","description":"最新发帖人","user":{"id":1,"username":"PalmPoetry","name":null,"avatar_template":"/user_avatar/palmpoetry.discourse.group/palmpoetry/{size}/7_2.png","admin":true,"moderator":true,"trust_level":4}}]},{"fancy_title":"【浪淘沙令】跑步（李煜体）","id":34,"title":"【浪淘沙令】跑步（李煜体）","slug":"topic","posts_count":1,"reply_count":0,"highest_post_number":1,"image_url":null,"created_at":"2026-09-05T00:45:27.779Z","last_posted_at":"2026-09-05T00:45:27.840Z","bumped":true,"bumped_at":"2026-09-05T00:45:27.840Z","archetype":"regular","unseen":false,"pinned":false,"unpinned":null,"excerpt":"【浪淘沙令】跑步（李煜体） \n作者/飞鸿 \n跑道沐霞光，唤醒操场。 \n轻盈脚步踏晨霜。岁月已随流水逝，旧景难忘。 \n湖柳醉斜阳，日暮苍茫。 \n故乡明月照他乡。回首青春长路远，润向何方？ \n注：润—近来网络流行词，来自英文run。 \n小荷点评：\u0026hellip;","visible":true,"closed":false,"archived":false,"bookmarked":null,"liked":null,"like_count":1,"views":5,"category_id":1,"featured_link":null,"op_like_count":1,"posters":[{"extras":"latest single","description":"原始发帖人、最新发帖人","user":{"id":4,"username":"Qinghongh","name":"user387","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/palmpoetry.discourse.group/qinghongh/{size}/22_2.png","trust_level":1}}]},{"fancy_title":"书法","id":27,"title":"书法","slug":"topic","posts_count":2,"reply_count":0,"highest_post_number":2,"image_url":"https://canada1.discourse-cdn.com/flex009/uploads/palmpoetry/optimized/1X/167f9777183d9b285330bee881e8760e635f2ef5_2_1024x554.jpeg","created_at":"2026-08-25T10:54:26.839Z","last_post